{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんからコメントすごく嬉しかったです。\nみなさんの気持ち、思い\n届きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりと胸にしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言いたいこと言ってよかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*******"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ私服載せちゃおうっと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カジュアルなのねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"顔出してぺっぴりごしになって撮ってるから\nシルエットがよくわからんわね。\nそして加工し過ぎて色が"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...わーおな感じ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中に着てるラグランTはRNAのもの。\nお気に入りったい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"aquagirlのカーキジャケットは半袖にもなるのだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさとかながわしのこと書いてたxD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやにやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなの記事はよく知らない用語がいっぱい出てきた。\nおもしろかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなしかっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさブログのあの謎の4枚の写真ね、\nみさの隠し撮り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動き過ぎてなにしてるかわからんかもやけど、\nあれはきっとエアギターしてるときやっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんでエアギタってんのにうしろから冷めた目で\nねねが見てたら噛み付いてやった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がうっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きゃっきゃっxD"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/04/17/9132557/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は‼\n喜んだらみさ先輩の作戦通りじゃないか"},{"t